SECTION      | KEY                | VALUE
----------------------------------------
META         | piece_id           | ring-board-token
STATE        | menu_stay_open     | 1
STATE        | grab_pointer       | 1
STATE        | grab_keyboard      | 1
METHOD       | Roll                 | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger roll'
METHOD       | Buy                  | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger buy'
METHOD       | Pass                 | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger pass'
METHOD       | End Turn             | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger endturn'
METHOD       | Pay Jail Fee         | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger payjail'
METHOD       | New Game             | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger setup'
METHOD       | Close                | CLOSE
METHOD       | Cancel               | void
